<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon says cuts CompUSA.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon says cuts CompUSA.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said it cut CompUSA Inc to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- said revenue growth has decelerated over the past few quarters.</p>
<p>-- said company has missed its revenue target recently.</p>
<p>-- said expects revenue growth in the low 20-25 percent range going forward.</p>
<p>-- CompUSA gained 1/8 to 23-3/8.</p>
</text>
